# Wellthlab DTC Brand Rules

Read `brand/assets.md`, `brand/voice.md`, and `brand/canva.md` before any production.

## Product imagery (non-negotiable)

- Show a product → use the **exact official image** from wellthlab.shop (Shopify CDN URL in brief or catalog).
- **Never** AI-generate, illustrate, hallucinate, or approximate product packaging, tins, strips, or labels.
- **Never** use stock or generic supplement imagery as a stand-in.
- If the product URL fails, fix it — do not proceed with a made-up product visual.

## Brand colors

Use only the hex tokens in `brand/canva.md` / `video/src/brand.ts`. Do not invent palettes.

## Brand tone

- Name: **Wellthlab** (not Wealth Lab)
- Voice: direct, confident, science-aware, human — see `brand/voice.md`
- FDA structure/function claims only; include disclaimer on supplement captions
- No fabricated reviews or social proof
